  (text "Section 7 of the circuit notes and the design notes. Low Blend is BassGrit's addition: the clean lower band, added at Low Blend x\nthe driven gain.\nUX2 sums both bands, inverted, at outTrim 1.2 (chosen) with +11.8 dB of make-up for the DSP's Level range of -40 to +12 dB\n(chosen).\nRVX4: the pedal's A100K Volume pot [6]. UX3 inverts back to the input's polarity (chosen). RVX3 is small against RX8 so the Low\nBlend\nlaw stays linear. The pedal's JFET buffer is replaced by this stage (section 7)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c88f30a3-0b25-5028-a967-46bf8e7fca70"))
